1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,575
Welcome to practicals twenty seven and twenty eight:

2
00:00:03,575 --> 00:00:08,112
P C A in Python, with the wine quality and breast cancer datasets.

3
00:00:08,912 --> 00:00:11,806
Practical twenty seven implements P C A:

4
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:17,449
load and scale, check V I F, fit P C A, variance explained, and how many P Cs.

5
00:00:17,449 --> 00:00:20,994
Practical twenty eight visualises and interprets:

6
00:00:20,994 --> 00:00:26,853
loadings heat map, P C scatter, loading plot, and a worked breast cancer example.

7
00:00:26,853 --> 00:00:39,152
We use wine quality, six thousand four hundred ninety seven rows, as the main example, and breast cancer, five sixty nine rows and thirty features, as the worked example.

8
00:00:39,952 --> 00:00:40,603
Step one:

9
00:00:40,603 --> 00:00:47,260
load the data, take the eleven lab measurements as features, and scale with Standard Scaler.

10
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,792
P C A follows the largest variance.

11
00:00:49,792 --> 00:00:57,173
Total sulfur dioxide has a standard deviation of fifty six point five, density only point oh oh three.

12
00:00:57,173 --> 00:01:05,204
Without scaling, P C one would explain ninety five percent only because sulfur dioxide has the biggest numbers.

13
00:01:05,204 --> 00:01:09,184
After scaling every feature has standard deviation one.

14
00:01:09,984 --> 00:01:10,696
Step two:

15
00:01:10,696 --> 00:01:13,467
check multicollinearity with V I F.

16
00:01:13,467 --> 00:01:22,095
It is the diagonal of the inverse correlation matrix, the same result as running eleven separate regressions.

17
00:01:22,095 --> 00:01:26,687
Density has fifteen point nine one, above ten, so serious.

18
00:01:26,687 --> 00:01:29,853
Residual sugar is seven point two three.

19
00:01:29,853 --> 00:01:34,523
Drop density and the largest V I F is two point eight four.

20
00:01:34,523 --> 00:01:37,848
P C A components always have V I F of one.

21
00:01:38,648 --> 00:01:39,455
Step three:

22
00:01:39,455 --> 00:01:48,044
fit P C A, keeping all eleven components, and call fit transform to learn the axes and give each wine its P C values.

23
00:01:48,044 --> 00:01:55,824
The result is still six thousand four hundred ninety seven by eleven, because P C A only rotates the axes.

24
00:01:55,824 --> 00:02:01,256
The correlation between P Cs is zero, so there is no repeated information.

25
00:02:02,056 --> 00:02:02,871
Step four:

26
00:02:02,871 --> 00:02:04,418
variance explained.

27
00:02:04,418 --> 00:02:12,320
Eigenvalue is the variance carried by a P C; on scaled data the total is eleven, one per feature.

28
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:18,592
P C one has eigenvalue three point oh three, twenty seven point five percent.

29
00:02:18,592 --> 00:02:21,362
P C two is twenty two point seven.

30
00:02:21,362 --> 00:02:27,064
Together they hold fifty percent, and seven P Cs reach ninety percent.

31
00:02:27,864 --> 00:02:39,288
Plot the scree plot, one bar per P C, which shows an elbow after P C three, and the cumulative plot, which crosses the ninety percent line at seven components.

32
00:02:40,088 --> 00:02:40,808
Step five:

33
00:02:40,808 --> 00:02:42,824
how many components to keep?

34
00:02:42,824 --> 00:02:45,200
Eigenvalue above one gives three.

35
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:55,136
Passing a number below one, like zero point nine, to n components means keep enough P Cs for ninety percent of the variance, giving seven.

36
00:02:55,136 --> 00:03:04,424
The elbow gives three for a quick look, Kaiser three for scaled data, and a ninety percent target seven to keep most information.

37
00:03:05,224 --> 00:03:06,016
Step six:

38
00:03:06,016 --> 00:03:09,448
loadings show what each P C is made of.

39
00:03:09,448 --> 00:03:11,560
Draw them as a heat map.

40
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:20,360
P C one is white style, sulfur dioxide and sugar, against red style, volatile acidity and chlorides.

41
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:24,760
P C two is heavy, density, against light, alcohol.

42
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:29,248
P C three is acidity, citric and fixed, against pH.

43
00:03:30,048 --> 00:03:30,883
Step seven:

44
00:03:30,883 --> 00:03:35,134
plot each wine on P C one and P C two, coloured by type.

45
00:03:35,134 --> 00:03:43,257
The average position of red wines is minus two point five one on P C one, white wines plus point eight two.

46
00:03:43,257 --> 00:03:51,456
P C A never saw type, yet red and white separate along P C one, so the name red versus white style is right.

47
00:03:52,256 --> 00:03:53,082
Step eight:

48
00:03:53,082 --> 00:03:56,538
the loading plot shows how the features point.

49
00:03:56,538 --> 00:04:01,347
One quiver call draws one arrow per feature, all in one command.

50
00:04:01,347 --> 00:04:06,906
Same direction means features rise together, like the two sulfur dioxides.

51
00:04:06,906 --> 00:04:11,264
Opposite means one up, one down, like density and alcohol.

52
00:04:12,064 --> 00:04:14,954
The same code on the breast cancer data.

53
00:04:14,954 --> 00:04:19,938
The largest V I F is mean radius at three thousand eight hundred six.

54
00:04:19,938 --> 00:04:25,140
P C one and P C two explain forty four point three and nineteen percent.

55
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:30,702
Seven of thirty P Cs reach ninety percent, and six have eigenvalue above one.

56
00:04:30,702 --> 00:04:40,744
Thirty features become two numbers that separate benign from malignant, with P C one meaning large, irregular shape, on the malignant side.

57
00:04:41,544 --> 00:04:43,271
What the lab showed.

58
00:04:43,271 --> 00:04:45,690
Scale, P C A, fit transform:

59
00:04:45,690 --> 00:04:47,417
three lines of code.

60
00:04:47,417 --> 00:04:47,849
Wine:

61
00:04:47,849 --> 00:04:55,277
P C one plus P C two is fifty percent; three P Cs by Kaiser, seven for ninety percent.

62
00:04:55,277 --> 00:05:00,718
Loadings name the P Cs, and the P C scatter confirms the names.

63
00:05:00,718 --> 00:05:07,801
And on breast cancer, thirty features become two P Cs that separate the diagnoses.

64
00:05:07,801 --> 00:05:09,528
Thanks for watching.

